    <p>Use the safety controls in a conversation to report content or block a user. Blocking ends the conversation and prevents future matching in either direction. You can also contact <a href="mailto:porporpor020202@gmail.com" class="underline">porporpor020202@gmail.com</a>.</p>
    <p class="mt-3">Reports are reviewed by the operator. Violations may result in content removal or account suspension. Suspected child exploitation and immediate threats require urgent review and appropriate action under applicable law.</p>
    <p class="mt-3">Read our <%= link_to "Child Safety Standards", child_safety_path, class: "underline" %> and <%= link_to "Privacy Policy", privacy_path, class: "underline" %>. Do not download or forward suspected child sexual abuse material. Contact local emergency services if someone is in immediate danger.</p>
